{"additions":1130,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nPressing `W` on a pull request (PR list or PR detail) shows the two commands about to run in a confirmation dialog; on `y` vig fetches the PR's head and adds a worktree for it, then switches to the Worktrees page with that worktree selected. The current checkout is never touched, and vig never removes a worktree.\n\nCloses #201\n\n![github demo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/td72/vig/feat/pr-worktree/assets/demo-github-pr.gif)\n\n## Changes\n\n- **github**: `\"W\" \"OpenWorktree\"` in `pr_list` and `pr_detail` (the issue said `w`, but `w` is the PR detail's watch toggle, so both places use `W`). A PR that already has a worktree (its branch checked out somewhere, or one at the planned path) is shown instead of being asked about again; a clashing directory or branch that is *not* a worktree of the PR is reported and nothing is created. The fetch + add runs on a worker thread; the result is applied on the next tick\n- **domain** `github/domain/pr_worktree.rs`: `WorktreePlan` (path / branch expansion, shown relative to the main worktree), `existing` / `conflict` / `run`:\n  ```\n  git fetch origin refs/pull/<n>/head\n  git worktree add <path> -b <branch> FETCH_HEAD\n  ```\n- **config**: `worktree-dir` (default `\"../\"`), `worktree-name` (`\"{repo}-pr-{n}\"`), `worktree-branch` (`\"pr/{n}\"`); `{n}` is mandatory\n- **core**: `AppContext::request_page` (a page asks for another page by id; windows close on the way), `select_worktree` (consumed by the Worktrees page on activation), `confirm_dialog::render_question`\n- **diff window**: `e` opens the file from the PR's worktree when one exists\n- **CLAUDE.md**: `git fetch` + `git worktree add` (behind a confirmation) join the allowed operations\n- **docs**: README / README.ja, the guide's GitHub chapter and Config Reference (en / ja)\n- **demo**: the PR tape presses `W`, shows the confirmation and cancels it (no network)\n\n## Tests\n\n- An integration test with a local origin holding `refs/pull/7/head`: fetch + worktree add, the PR's head checked out, the main checkout untouched; conflict detection; path normalisation; config defaults / overrides / validation\n- GitHub page: `W` shows the dialog (rendered text, other keys ignored, `n` / `Esc` cancel), an existing worktree switches pages, a finished add (or its error) is applied on tick\n- Worktrees page selection hand-over, `App::request_page`\n- `cargo test`: 436 passed; clippy / fmt / pre-commit pass; GIF re-recorded\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01N7wFSHbpTzvkK6WS1CRS7b","changedFiles":33,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-23T10:26:50Z","deletions":36,"headRefName":"feat/pr-worktree","isDraft":false,"labels":[],"number":203,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABT2XenA","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nUnresolved worktree correctness and completion-handling issues, incomplete command visibility, and a detached-HEAD-sensitive CI test block approval.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>5 open issues</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Use an isolated repository with a known branch in the test](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596413) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Wrap or inspect long dialog arguments before confirmation](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596453) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Validate PR association before accepting a matching worktree path](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596499) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Resolve the main worktree before constructing plan paths](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596562) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Deliver background operation completions independently of the active page](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596601) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds `W` to open a GitHub pull request as a local worktree after confirmation, connecting PR inspection with the existing Worktrees view without changing the current checkout.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds background fetch/worktree creation, reuse checks, and Worktrees selection.\n- Introduces configurable worktree paths and names, plus PR-worktree file editing.\n- Updates tests, English/Japanese documentation, and the PR demo.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `tape/​demo-github-pr.tape` | Demonstrates confirmation and cancellation. |\r\n| `src/​worktrees/​state.rs` | Consumes requested worktree selection. |\r\n| `src/​worktrees/​panes/​worktrees.rs` | Adds selection by canonical path. |\r\n| `src/​projects/​state.rs` | Updates test context initialization. |\r\n| `src/​projects/​panes/​board.rs` | Updates rendering test contexts. |\r\n| `src/​procs/​state.rs` | Updates test context initialization. |\r\n| `src/​pages.rs` | Passes the repository root to GitHub. |\r\n| `src/​main.rs` | Initializes navigation request fields. |\r\n| `src/​github/​state.rs` | Coordinates confirmation, workers, and navigation. |\r\n| `src/​github/​pr_diff.rs` | Supplies the PR checkout to diff windows. |\r\n| `src/​github/​panes/​pr_list.rs` | Emits worktree requests for PRs. |\r\n| `src/​github/​panes/​gh_list.rs` | Dispatches the worktree action. |\r\n| `src/​github/​panes/​detail_view/​mod.rs` | Supports worktree requests from PR details. |\r\n| `src/​github/​page.rs` | Accepts a repository working directory. |\r\n| `src/​github/​domain/​pr_worktree.rs` | Adds worktree planning, execution, and tests. |\r\n| `src/​github/​domain/​mod.rs` | Registers the worktree module. |\r\n| `src/​diff_window/​state.rs` | Prefers PR-worktree files for editing. |\r\n| `src/​core/​ui/​status_bar.rs` | Shows worktree operation progress. |\r\n| `src/​core/​ui/​confirm_dialog.rs` | Adds reusable confirmation rendering. |\r\n| `src/​core/​pane.rs` | Defines the PR worktree event. |\r\n| `src/​core/​config/​mod.rs` | Exports worktree settings. |\r\n| `src/​core/​config/​merge.rs` | Supports worktree configuration overrides. |\r\n| `src/​core/​config/​loader.rs` | Loads and validates worktree settings. |\r\n| `src/​core/​app.rs` | Handles cross-page navigation requests. |\r\n| `README.md` | Documents the feature and shortcut. |\r\n| `docs/​README.ja.md` | Adds Japanese feature documentation. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​src/​views-github.md` | Explains the worktree workflow. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​src/​config-reference.md` | Documents settings and actions. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​ja/​src/​views-github.md` | Explains the workflow in Japanese. |\r\n| `docs/​guide/​ja/​src/​config-reference.md` | Documents settings and actions in Japanese. |\r\n| `CLAUDE.md` | Documents confirmed fetch/add as allowed operations. |\r\n| `assets/​demo-github-pr.gif` | Updates the recorded PR demo. |\r\n| `assets/​default.kdl` | Adds worktree defaults and `W` bindings. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","submittedAt":"2026-10-23T10:32:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"793f95406a72477a217cf9e5b099f74e50eb6fdd"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABT2arcQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nRepository selection and shared fetch state can cause a worktree to contain the wrong PR or commit.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>6 open issues</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Fetch PR from the repository selected by gh](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358638473) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Avoid FETCH_HEAD races when fetching PR worktrees](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358638535) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Deliver background operation completions independently of the active page](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596601)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Resolve the main worktree before constructing plan paths](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596562)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Validate PR association before accepting a matching worktree path](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596499)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Wrap or inspect long dialog arguments before confirmation](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596453)\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>1 resolved since last review</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Use an isolated repository with a known branch in the test](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/203#discussion_r4358596413)\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","submittedAt":"2026-10-23T10:38:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"e9c6f03c196ca4337dc99156084ef705b3801a21"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:37:28Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39940418277/job/120370185801","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:37:28Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:32:53Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39939490725/job/120367142162","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:29:45Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:30:17Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39939490529/job/120367141368","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:29:44Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:30:46Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39939490725/job/120367142532","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:29:47Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:35:23Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39939490725/job/120367142568","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:29:45Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:35:24Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39939490725/job/120369388801","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:35:24Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:37:28Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39940418277/job/120370240859","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:37:37Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:31:12Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39939490529/job/120367141668","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:29:45Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:31:09Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39939490529/job/120367141685","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:29:44Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:37:28Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39940418277/job/120370239349","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:37:37Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"✨ GitHub: open a pull request as a worktree (`W`)"}
